{#
    Share of puzzlers holding an achievement tier, for the detail sheet (docs/features/xp-levels/ux-polish/design-spec.md
    §8.5): the locale's percent format, one decimal under 10 %, "< 0.1 %" for a tier held by a tiny share (never "0 %"
    for a held tier), "Nobody yet" when nobody holds it. Long form says how many hold it and their share ("Held by 334 puzzlers (4.2 %)") - Jan 2026-10-11: the XP
    denominator is noise, the number of holders is what people want to know.
    Inputs: percent (float 0-100, AchievementRarityProvider), holders (int), long (bool), plain (bool, default false: unescaped
    text for a translation parameter - the caller's trans output is escaped once; numbers and our own strings only).
#}
{%- if holders <= 0 -%}
    {{ 'badges.medal.nobody_yet'|trans }}
{%- else -%}
    {%- set tiny = percent < 0.1 -%}
    {%- set shown = tiny ? 0.1 : percent -%}
    {%- set digits = shown < 10 ? 1 : 0 -%}
    {%- set formatted = (shown / 100)|format_percent_number({min_fraction_digit: digits, max_fraction_digit: digits}) -%}
    {%- if long -%}
        {{ (tiny ? 'badges.medal.share_below' : 'badges.medal.share')|trans({'%count%': holders, '%percent%': formatted}) }}
    {%- elseif plain|default(false) -%}
        {{ (tiny ? '< ' ~ formatted : formatted)|raw }}
    {%- else -%}
        {{ tiny ? '< ' ~ formatted : formatted }}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
